<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<h1>Mattermost Bridge</h1>
<p class="tl-subtitle">
    Pushes new customer chat messages into a Mattermost channel via Mattermost's own "Incoming
    Webhook" integration. Replies come back via a Mattermost outgoing webhook or slash command
    you configure on the Mattermost side to POST to this server's <code>/mattermost/reply</code>.
</p>

<% if (!integration) { %>
<form method="post" action="/admin/mattermost/create" class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-filters">
        <div style="flex:2"><label>Mattermost Incoming Webhook URL</label>
            <input name="incoming_webhook_url" style="width:100%" placeholder="https://your-mattermost.example.com/hooks/xxxxxxxxxxxx" required>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="tl-subtitle">Create this in Mattermost: System Console → Integrations → Incoming Webhooks → Add Incoming Webhook, pick a channel, copy the URL here.</p>
    <button class="tl-btn" type="submit">Connect Mattermost</button>
</form>
<% } else { %>
<div class="tl-card">
    <p><strong>Status:</strong> <%= integration.is_active ? 'Connected' : 'Disabled' %></p>
    <p><strong>Incoming Webhook:</strong> <code><%= integration.incoming_webhook_url %></code></p>
    <p><strong>Reply shared secret</strong> (use as the <code>token</code> in your Mattermost outgoing webhook/slash command config):</p>
    <code style="display:block;padding:10px;background:#f4f6fa;border-radius:6px"><%= integration.reply_shared_secret %></code>
    <p class="tl-subtitle" style="margin-top:14px">
        In Mattermost, add a Slash Command (or Outgoing Webhook) with request URL
        <code>https://YOUR-TECHLIFE-HOST/mattermost/reply</code>, method POST, and the token above.
        Agents reply with: <code>/techlife-reply CONV-A1B2C3 your message here</code>
    </p>
</div>
<% } %>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
